{
  // NOTHING KEPT FOR LATER - emo.
  //
  // Close cousin to the alt rock preset and deliberately so - at the engine
  // level they are the same style of thing, and what separates them is the
  // writing rather than the groove. Being honest about that is better than
  // inventing a difference in the generator that nobody asked for.
  //
  // What actually makes this one emo is in the chart: it lives on the relative
  // major, so the chords are bright while the key is not; the choruses are
  // longer than the verses, which is unusual and is why they feel like release
  // rather than arrival; and there is no solo anywhere. The guitar plays
  // driving eighths almost continuously rather than sitting out, which is the
  // other half of the sound.

